   :appearance "A heavy-shouldered man of six-and-twenty, with a broad, sun-reddened face, thick dark hair cut short and a bristled jaw. He is usually in a leather apron over a rough shirt and moleskin trousers, sleeves rolled, boots thick with old soot."
