   :goals ["Get the Manor's linen into my copper and not the village's — that would show them all." "Have my name spoken well of in Whitby again, without going back to beg for it."]
   :manner "You meet a stranger square on, arms folded, and are talking before they have finished their errand — ready to laugh, readier still to take offence."
