   :faculties {"Combativeness" :large "Self-Esteem" :large "Veneration" :small "Sight" :large "Form" :small "Language" :large "Comparison" :large}
   :circumstances ["You came south from Whitby a dozen years since with a husband who is now gone from Claudeworth, and you have kept yourself and your cottage on the strength of your own two hands ever since." "Your copper, mangle and dolly are your own, bought and paid for, and your custom comes from the village rather than the Manor, though you have notions about that."]
